Default year to add as a tag to all entries.
</p>

<div class="org-src-container">
<pre class="src src-emacs-lisp">(<span style="color: #ea3d54; font-weight: bold;">setq</span> jira-to-org-default-year <span style="color: #4fb3d8;">"2025"</span>)
</pre>
